<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>WebTrip - Discover the Internet</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🌐 WebTrip</h1>
    <p>Discover what happens when you visit a website!</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="intro">
      <h2>Your journey starts here</h2>
      <p>Enter a website address and explore how the internet works behind the scenes.</p>

      <input id="website" type="text"
        placeholder="Example: www.example.com">

      <button id="startButton">Start my journey</button>
    </section>

    <section class="journey">
      <h2>Your website journey</h2>
      <div id="progress">Step 0 of 4</div>

      <div class="stage">
        <h3 id="stageTitle">Ready to explore?</h3>
        <p id="stageText">
          Enter a website address above to begin.
        </p>
      </div>

      <button id="nextButton" disabled>Next step →</button>
      <button id="resetButton">Start again</button>
    </section>

    <section class="facts">
      <h2>Did you know?</h2>
      <p>DNS is often described as the internet's phonebook
        because it helps translate website names into IP addresses.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>WebTrip | Learn. Explore. Understand.</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
